  "description": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>America's best-selling cargo eBike <meta charset=\"utf-8\">has been reimagined with an all-new design. Introducing the XPedition 2.0, Lectric\u2019s most advanced cargo carrier yet. Engineered to conquer even the steepest hills and carry up to 450 lbs of load, this eBike is versatile enough for a wide range of riders. Now upgraded with a torque sensor to deliver an unparalleled pedal assist experience, an 8-speed Shimano shifter, 1,310W peak motor, color LCD display, and a longer frame with updated tubing. Enjoy a smoother ride with a front suspension fork, and travel farther with up to 35Ah of battery life. Paired with a line of tailor-made accessories to elevate your riding experience!</span></p>"
